- libgpiod C API documentation: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git/tree/bindings/c/README.md
- Raspberry Pi GPIO documentation: https://www.raspberrypi.org/documentation/usage/gpio/
- Hall-effect sensor datasheet: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/drv5055va.pdf
