# Raspberry Pi 4 Model B

## Specifications

* Broadcom BCM2711, Quad core Cortex-A72 (ARM v8) 64-bit SoC @ 1.5GHz
* 1GB, 2GB or 4GB LPDDR4-3200 SDRAM (depending on model)
