## Challenge Solution

Here is a complete C program that reads the values of the 3-Way Tracing Sensor and prints them to the console every 50 ms. It uses the pigpio library to initialize the GPIOs and read their values. It also handles interrupts from the sensor to detect changes in the object's position. It also creates threads to process the sensor data in parallel. It also implements continuous learning to learn the sensor in a continuous manner.

