- pigpio library documentation: https://abyz.me.uk/rpi/pigpio/index.html
- Keywish KY-032 Infrared Obstacle Avoidance sensor datasheet: https://www.keywish.net/products/ky-032-infrared-obstacle-avoidance-sensor
