The Raspberry Pi Zero W is a small and affordable single-board computer (SBC) that is perfect for prototyping and DIY projects. It is a low-cost alternative to the Raspberry Pi 3 and 4, and it has a wide range of applications in the home automation, robotics, and IoT (Internet of Things) fields.

## Features

