Write a C program for a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ that uses the pigpio library to read ambient light levels from a BH1750 sensor at I2C address 0x23 on I2C1 (GPIO2=SDA, GPIO3=SCL). Trigger a relay on GPIO23 to activate a grow light when the lux reading falls below 150, and deactivate it when lux is 150 or above. Use the BH1750 One-Time High-Resolution mode (command 0x20) and wait at least 120 ms for the conversion before reading

